WEBVTT

00:00:08.381 --> 00:00:09.466
(BEEPS)

00:00:10.374 --> 00:00:12.723
SHANNON: Your accent is so exotic.

00:00:12.986 --> 00:00:15.090
Ah. Well, thank you very much.

00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:17.348
I know someone who can fix that for you.

00:00:17.474 --> 00:00:19.698
And you'll be talking normal in no time!

00:00:20.435 --> 00:00:21.478
(FAKE CHUCKLES)

00:00:22.295 --> 00:00:24.647
Whoo. Is it hot in here?

00:00:26.794 --> 00:00:28.526
How's the food?

00:00:29.569 --> 00:00:33.245
Wait a minute. Wait a minute.
Are you wearing a wig?

00:00:33.569 --> 00:00:36.326
What?
Ah! I don't think so.

00:00:36.409 --> 00:00:37.702
I knew it.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.908
You're a phony. I hate phonies!

00:00:39.961 --> 00:00:42.193
Oh, what? No. These locks are all mine.

00:00:42.237 --> 00:00:43.583
No, they're not!

00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:46.766
You know what I'm gonna do?
I'm gonna rip that thing off your head,

00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:49.798
and show everyone
what a bald-headed phony you are.

00:00:49.991 --> 00:00:51.174
I don't think so, Miss Lady.

00:00:56.679 --> 00:00:57.972
(YELPS)

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.185
Hello?

00:01:02.368 --> 00:01:03.636
Hello? Are you...

00:01:03.741 --> 00:01:04.896
LUCY: Hey, Gru.

00:01:04.979 --> 00:01:07.989
Hello, Lucy. How are you doing?

00:01:08.163 --> 00:01:10.077
Wow, looks like your date's out
for the count.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.183
It's like she's been shot
with a mild moose tranquilizer.

00:01:13.738 --> 00:01:14.989
(MOANS LIKE A MOOSE)

00:01:19.452 --> 00:01:21.759
Yeah, I'm winking
because that's what actually happened.

00:01:22.462 --> 00:01:25.055
Scusi, what's happening here?
She no like?

00:01:25.528 --> 00:01:26.845
Oh, she's just, uh...

00:01:28.861 --> 00:01:29.921
(CHUCKLING) Oh, ho.

00:01:30.004 --> 00:01:31.093
Sì, sì. (CHUCKLES) Sì.

00:01:32.228 --> 00:01:33.300
Shall we take her home?

00:01:44.561 --> 00:01:45.562
Oh!

00:02:15.925 --> 00:02:19.140
Well, I think you did it.You just
officially had the worst date ever.

00:02:19.637 --> 00:02:21.055
Huh, tell me about it.

00:02:21.556 --> 00:02:24.269
Don't worry.
It can only get better from here, right?

00:02:24.832 --> 00:02:26.811
But if it doesn't,
you can always borrow my dart gun.

00:02:26.936 --> 00:02:28.737
I've had to use it
on one or two dates myself.

00:02:29.564 --> 00:02:31.566
Yeah, you know, as far as dates go,

00:02:31.779 --> 00:02:33.660
I think I'm good with just the one.

00:02:34.777 --> 00:02:35.862
(CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

00:02:37.947 --> 00:02:40.710
Well, good night, partner.

00:02:43.369 --> 00:02:44.454
This was fun.

00:02:44.537 --> 00:02:46.542
Yes. Surprisingly, it was.

00:02:47.857 --> 00:02:49.971
Oh, and, uh, just between you and me?

00:02:51.002 --> 00:02:52.207
You look much better bald.

00:02:55.381 --> 00:02:56.674
See you tomorrow.

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:07.435
Quack, quack, quack, quack, quack!

00:03:07.518 --> 00:03:08.937
(KISSING)

00:03:10.897 --> 00:03:11.940
(IMITATING A WALRUS)

00:03:13.176 --> 00:03:14.317
Yay!

00:03:14.462 --> 00:03:15.804
So, I take it the date went well?

00:03:16.009 --> 00:03:18.363
No, it was horrible. (CHUCKLES)

00:03:19.572 --> 00:03:20.657
(HUMMING)

00:03:29.123 --> 00:03:31.626
High-five! (IMITATES GUNSHOT)

00:03:32.502 --> 00:03:33.628
Bump it.

00:03:34.379 --> 00:03:35.421
(GASPS)

00:04:10.957 --> 00:04:12.000
(GASPS)

00:04:13.126 --> 00:04:14.711
(DISPATCH CHATTERING ON RADIO)

00:04:15.962 --> 00:04:17.504
Mr. Ramsbottom?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:19.132
Oh, hello.

00:04:19.299 --> 00:04:20.591
What are you doing here?

00:04:20.755 --> 00:04:22.335
-We got him.
-Got who?

00:04:22.789 --> 00:04:24.024
Floyd Eaglesan!

00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:27.298
Our agents located
a secret room in his shop last night

00:04:27.414 --> 00:04:28.975
and discovered this.

00:04:29.409 --> 00:04:32.943
It's empty,but we found traces
of the PX-41 serum in it.

00:04:33.756 --> 00:04:34.924
He's our man.

00:04:35.001 --> 00:04:39.027
So, somehow, in spite
of your incompetence, we solved this one.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:40.959
I was framed!

00:04:41.264 --> 00:04:42.577
You won't get away with this!

00:04:42.861 --> 00:04:45.700
Get your mitts off of me!
I am a legitimate businessman.

00:04:46.785 --> 00:04:48.975
Ah. All right. So what now?

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.350
Well, now you're free to go
back to your business.

00:04:52.623 --> 00:04:54.486
Mmm. Jams and jellies.

00:04:55.193 --> 00:04:59.227
And it looks like Agent Wilde will be
transferring to our Australian branch.

00:04:59.964 --> 00:05:01.215
Australia?

00:05:01.299 --> 00:05:02.402
Yes.

00:05:02.429 --> 00:05:03.855
But thank you for everything.

00:05:04.219 --> 00:05:06.503
And by everything,
of course I mean nothing.

00:05:07.347 --> 00:05:09.049
Toodle pip and cheerio, Mr. Gru.

00:05:14.479 --> 00:05:15.973
-Hey, there.
-Hey.

00:05:16.526 --> 00:05:17.599
So, we got him.

00:05:18.062 --> 00:05:20.401
Yay. That's great.

00:05:21.097 --> 00:05:22.799
And now you're going to Australia?

00:05:23.193 --> 00:05:25.665
Well, it's not definite yet.
I'm still figuring it out.

00:05:26.279 --> 00:05:27.488
I've already been working on my accent.

00:05:28.171 --> 00:05:30.311
Wallaby. Didgeridoo.

00:05:30.487 --> 00:05:32.944
Hugh Jackman. (CHUCKLES)

00:05:33.664 --> 00:05:36.697
So, um... Pretty excited.

00:05:38.211 --> 00:05:39.437
Great.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:41.398
Well, good luck.

00:05:41.983 --> 00:05:43.754
Thanks. You, too.

00:05:45.663 --> 00:05:48.111
Oh! Here. I wanted to give you this.

00:05:48.779 --> 00:05:50.121
Your lipstick taser?

00:05:50.426 --> 00:05:52.075
Yeah, it's just a memento.

00:05:52.288 --> 00:05:55.656
Just, you know, from
the first time we met.

00:05:56.426 --> 00:05:58.375
Oh. Thank you, Lucy.

00:05:59.589 --> 00:06:00.674
SILAS: Agent Wilde.

00:06:01.818 --> 00:06:04.357
Well, it looks like they need you, so...

00:06:04.821 --> 00:06:06.594
Yeah, I better go.

00:06:08.699 --> 00:06:10.159
Bye, Gru.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:25.633
(DRUMMER EXCLAIMS IN DISMAY)

00:06:29.846 --> 00:06:31.013
(WOMEN GRUNTING)

